(gen_random_uuid(), 'montreal', 'neighborhood_decode', 'Follow bilingual greeting past the postcard', 'A local route or courtesy rule can reveal where Montreal becomes usable rather than staged. Let bilingual greeting and the posted guidance pull you past the obvious frame.', 'bilingual greeting source', '🧭', null, '{"source": "https://nos-langues.canada.ca/fr/cles-de-la-redaction/bon-matin"}'::jsonb, '{"accessed": "2026-08-02", "confidence": "documented", "neighborhood": "citywide", "profile": "local-expert-addons", "review_state": "source_checked", "rights": "original_lore_copy", "wave": "2026-08"}'::jsonb, 'https://nos-langues.canada.ca/fr/cles-de-la-redaction/bon-matin', 'cc0', 201, 'reference_only'),
